<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 81 0 R/T(The brief: To communicate Prakriya\220s nature-led approach to education through a nature-focused reel that presents the trees on its campus as teachers in their own right.)/E(The brief: To communicate Prakriya\220s nature-led approach to education through a nature-focused reel that presents the trees on its campus as teachers in their own right.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

153 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 81 0 R/T(Prakriya Green Wisdom School is a Bengaluru-based educational institution built around a philosophy of experiential and nature-based learning. With its motto, \215Education for Life\216, the school places equal importance on academic understanding, individual growth, critical thinking, and a child's relationship with the natural world. Its approach encourages children to learn through non-conventional and experiential learning pathways.)/E(Prakriya Green Wisdom School is a Bengaluru-based educational institution built around a philosophy of experiential and nature-based learning. With its motto, \215Education for Life\216, the school places equal importance on academic understanding, individual growth, critical thinking, and a child's relationship with the natural world. Its approach encourages children to learn through non-conventional and experiential learning pathways.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

154 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 81 0 R/T(Writing reel scripts lets an idea in my head turn into a tiny little film I can look at with joy and )/E(Writing reel scripts lets an idea in my head turn into a tiny little film I can look at with joy and )/Pg 11 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

155 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H6/P 81 0 R/T(pride. Being an avid reader, I\220ve been well-versed in fiction and imagination since childhood, and reel scripts let me put all of it on paper and, eventually, on screen.)/E(pride. Being an avid reader, I\220ve been well-versed in fiction and imagination since childhood, and reel scripts let me put all of it on paper and, eventually, on screen.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[9]>>
