184 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 82 0 R/E(A child settles against the trunk with a book while another absent-mindedly traces the grooves in the bark with their fingers. Two children compare sketches they have just finished. Their educator walks over only after they have begun the conversation, crouching beside them to look at the sketches instead of correcting them. \(1+1+2 children + 1 teacher\))/Pg 12 0 R/K[6]>>
