747 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 102 0 R/E(Our Little Cake Shop is a boutique baking studio specialising in custom-designed cakes, handcrafted fondant figurines and seasonal flavour combinations. Founded by Amritha Upadhyay, the business creates bespoke cakes for birthdays, anniversaries and personal milestones, with a focus on individual designs, small-batch preparation and fresh ingredients.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

748 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 102 0 R/E(The brief: To create a brand feature article highlighting Our Little Cake Shop\220s ten-year journey, its personalised approach to cake design and its attention to flavour and craftsmanship.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

749 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 102 0 R/E(Shortcopy makes mesay complex things in a few words. Long-form gives me the space to )/Pg 32 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

750 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 102 0 R/E(explore an idea in depth, build a narrative and let a thought develop into a conclusion. I enjoy the freedom to experiment with language, structure and storytelling, and to give an idea the space it needs without losing the reader.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

751 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 102 0 R/E(At Our Little Cake Shop, sugar, creativity and pure joy come together to create cakes that do far more than mark an occasion\204they capture entire lifetimes in every single slice. For a decade now, the venture has masterfully been adding a thoughtful touch to everyday celebrations. What once began as a humble experiment in a home kitchen has blossomed into a boutique baking studio, where every cake is shaped with such genuine care that you can practically taste the story and personality baked right into it.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

752 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 102 0 R/E(Here, no cake arrives ready-made from a display case. Instead, each one starts with a heartfelt conversation that peels back the layers of someone\220s story. Is this a little girl who dreams of princesses? A couple marking a quarter-century of shared sunrises? Or the excited circle of family and friends preparing to welcome a tiny new life? These intimate clues become the blueprint, guiding every swirl of icing and placement of fondant until the finished cake radiates the exact mood of the day.)/Pg 32 0 R/K[12 910 0 R]>>
endobj

