<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(Parsi cuisine with the flavours and food culture of Bombay. Its menu draws from traditional recipes, local street food and the culinary influences that have shaped the city. The restaurant is led by Rehana Contractor and Arpitha Rai, alongside master karigars specialising in Bohri cooking.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

768 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(The Tempt Bakehouse is a small, boutique bakery in Bengaluru. Operating out of an 80-)/Pg 33 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

769 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(square-foot space, the bakehouse specialises in brownies, cheesecakes and shokupan breads, with an emphasis on fresh ingredients, seasonal flavours and small-batch baking. Its philosophy centres on honest indulgence, prioritising flavour and quality over excess sweetness or elaborate presentation.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

770 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(The brief: To create a brand feature article introducing The Tempt Bakehouse, its founder and the philosophy behind its approach to baking.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

771 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(The Bombay Chapter 003 is a restaurant in JP Nagar, Bengaluru, bringing together Bohri and )/Pg 33 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

772 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(The brief: To create a brand feature article introducing The Bombay Chapter 003 through its culinary influences, food philosophy and the people behind the kitchen.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

773 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(There\220s a part of Bombay that rarely makes the glossy lists, but lives vividly in a local\220s mouth and memory: the part of the city that smells of melting ghee on hot malpua, where a pressure-cooker whistle threads down a narrow gali, and Friday tastes like khichda crowned with caramelised onion and passion. That is the city The Bombay Chapter 003 carries into its room in Bangalore\204not as a form of imitation, but as a mood crafted from sound, scent and habit.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

774 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 103 0 R/E(The alleys tucked between Bhendi Bazaar\220s crumbling balconies and the bright, busy sweep of Mohammad Ali Road, is the starting place of The Bombay Chapter 003. Here, the focus is Bohri cooking: food made in thaals, meant to be shared, served with the kind of stillness that urges you to lose yourself in the food. Yet, the story stretches wider than one cuisine. It\220s Bombay itself, where borrowed recipes and blended accents come together in flavours that are bold, warm, and possessing the effortless confidence that only the city itself can carry.)/Pg 33 0 R/K[14 912 0 R]>>
endobj

