endobj

783 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 104 0 R/E(On a narrow Bangalore street where honking scooters and impatient conversations blur into )/Pg 34 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

784 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 104 0 R/E(constant chaos, asoft scentcuts through\204warm bread, fresh fruit, the faintest trace of real, unadulterated vanilla. It leads to an 80-square-foot nook you could almost miss if you weren\220t paying attention. Yet, step inside and the world outside fades into the background, replaced by the persisting confidence of a space that firmly believes indulgence can be authentic.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

785 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 104 0 R/E(The Tempt Bakehouse doesn\220t scream for attention with glass cases stacked high or neon lights blinding the eyes. Instead, there\220s a subtle sense of humility: a cheesecake gleaming like porcelain under soft light, shokupan loaves resting in perfect rows, brownies whose edges promise a crackle that gives way to velvet. Even the air in here feels composed\204 warmth from the oven rising like a sigh, mingling with the low murmur of conversation and the occasional scrape of a cake tin being set down. Every detail feels deliberate, as though the space has been taught to speak softly so the food can be loud.)/Pg 34 0 R/K[4 914 0 R]>>
endobj

