endobj

798 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(I\220m using the central tension that avocado ice cream sits precariously between two worlds: health and indulgence. Instead of picking a side, I\220ve used the contradiction to my favour. For the first line, by leading with colour \(\215greenest\216\), I\220ve done two jobs at once - used it as a visual cue \(you see the ice cream before you eat it\) and a health signal \(it\220s green, so it must be good for health\). \215Mouth melting delight\216 then digs into the indulgence factor.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

799 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(For the second line, I\220ve dropped the sensory aspect and dived into identity. \215Cheat code\216 speaks directly to someone who wants the pleasure of ice cream without the cholesterol intake, reframing avocado as the secret weapon rather than the weird ingredient.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

800 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(The third line makes the most direct contradiction. It splits the experience into what it tastes like in your mouth vs what it feels like in your head, and resolves both in the consumer\220s favour. The word \215guilty\216 is immediately cancelled out by \215good decision\216, the exact mental negotiation someone needs to go through before choosing this product over any other dessert.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

801 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(So rather than being limited by the weirdness of the product, I\220ve used it as leverage.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

802 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(A few pieces that came outof job application assignments, along with ideas I wanted to explore )/Pg 35 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

803 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(on my own. They let me step outside the usual briefs and try different ways of thinking, writing and approaching a product.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

804 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(Assignment)/Pg 35 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

805 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 105 0 R/T(Write taglines for a product I hate)/E(Write taglines for a product I hate)/Pg 35 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

806 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 105 0 R/E(The brief: Avocado ice cream. \(In my opinion, a crime against both fruit and dessert. Keep the green away from my dessert\))/Pg 35 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

807 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 105 0 R/T(The greenest mouth-melting delight)/E(The greenest mouth-melting delight)/Pg 35 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

808 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 105 0 R/T(Nature\220s cheat code for ice cream)/E(Nature\220s cheat code for ice cream)/Pg 35 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

809 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 105 0 R/T(Tastes like guilty pleasure. Feels like a good decision.)/E(Tastes like guilty pleasure. Feels like a good decision.)/Pg 35 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

