<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(What is it to be lonely, you ask?)/Pg 37 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

840 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Loneliness is the ghost that hangs on your back with its arms around your neck, firmly yet gently as you linger in the midst)/Pg 37 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

841 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(of people giving you their widest smiles. Loneliness is holding back tears)/Pg 37 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

842 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(when you have no reason to cry;)/Pg 37 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

843 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Ah, the dreaded alarm sound, which could make you loathe your favourite song. Intrusive thoughts sweep past you, telling you to smash the mobile phone across the wall.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

844 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(If that doesn't do the trick, jump, stomp, crush it with your feet.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

845 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(But alas...)/Pg 37 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

846 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(your arms can only do as much to shut your phone up.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

847 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(You do not open your eyes.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

848 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(There's nothing you want to see.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

849 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(You do not pull yourself upright.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

850 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(You can't tell if it's because you don't want to, or your body won't cooperate.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

851 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(The alarm rings again, because you accidentally snoozed it.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

852 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E("What am I supposed to do today?")/Pg 37 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

853 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Without making the slightest of movement, you make a checklist of things to do for the day.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

854 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Nothing comes to mind.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[20]>>
endobj

855 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(The fridge is empty, the house--dirty, but your to-do list?)/Pg 37 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

856 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Your to-do list remains empty as ever.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

857 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(Poetry is where I write for myself. These pieces come from a deep desire to connect and express, )/Pg 37 0 R/K[23]>>
endobj

858 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 107 0 R/E(and they are my way of tracing life\220s map with all its detours and dead ends still visible.)/Pg 37 0 R/K[24]>>
endobj

